WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.346 line:75% position:50% size:90%
Create an account or sign in, then create a business. This recording
uses a disposable local demo identity.

2
00:00:07.346 --> 00:00:14.588 line:75% position:50% size:90%
Enter your company name, industry and simulated starting resources.
Complete your business profile before planning.

3
00:00:14.588 --> 00:00:21.831 line:75% position:50% size:90%
Describe the outcome, budget and constraints. Generate a draft plan;
do not activate it before reviewing the assignments.

4
00:00:21.831 --> 00:00:29.973 line:75% position:50% size:90%
Review the department, objective, exact payload and success criteria.
Activation may run eligible work under existing policies.

5
00:00:29.973 --> 00:00:37.021 line:75% position:50% size:90%
Inspect the five departments and recorded work. The boardroom
visualizes actual saved records; its preview is illustrative.

6
00:00:37.021 --> 00:00:46.470 line:75% position:50% size:90%
Check the task payload and simulation/live mode. Owner approval is
separate from CEO review and can execute an eligible action.

7
00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:53.685 line:75% position:50% size:90%
The owner decision returns to the department. The saved status
refreshes; this demo result is simulated, not a real publication.

8
00:00:53.685 --> 00:01:02.600 line:75% position:50% size:90%
Read task status, decision history and available reports. Executed is
different from delivered or verified complete. Connect external
accounts only after setup and permission checks.
